  "description": {
    "en": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (en): Marrubium vulgare",
      "source_url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Marrubium_vulgare",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 1371758529,
      "text": "Marrubium vulgare is a flowering plant in the mint family (Lamiaceae), native to Europe, northern Africa, and southwestern and central Asia. Specifically, it emerged in the region between the Mediterranean Sea and Central Asia and now inhabits all continents save Antarctica. It is also widely naturalized in many places, including most of North and South America."
    },
    "es": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (es): Marrubium vulgare",
      "source_url": "https://es.wikipedia.org/wiki/Marrubium_vulgare",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 175384439,
      "text": "Marrubium vulgare, llamado marrubio, hierba del sapo o toronjil cuyano, es una planta herbácea de la familia de las Lamiaceae. Su nombre científico deriva del hebreo {mar} (amargo) y {rob} (jugo). La aplicación en la medicina tradicional más extendida de M. vulgare en todo el mundo es para el tratamiento de trastornos gastrointestinales y respiratorios."
    },
    "fr": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (fr): Marrube blanc",
      "source_url": "https://fr.wikipedia.org/wiki/Marrube_blanc",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 234152042,
      "text": "Le marrube blanc, marrube commun, ou simplement marrube ou marube, est une espèce de plantes à fleurs du genre Marrubium, de la famille des Lamiaceae. C'est une plante herbacée originaire d’Europe, d’Afrique du Nord et d’Asie."
    },
    "pt": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (pt): Marrubium vulgare",
      "source_url": "https://pt.wikipedia.org/wiki/Marrubium_vulgare",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 68259195,
      "text": "Marrubium vulgare, comummente conhecida como marroio-branco, é uma espécie de planta com flor, pertencente à família das Labiadas e ao tipo fisionómico dos hemicriptófitos."
    }
  },
